      "title": "Observability pipeline",
      "description": "An invented platform team, Halyard Ops. Every request a shop service handles sends logs, spans and metrics to node agents, then through load-balanced gateway collectors that tail-sample traces, into Kafka. Kafka buffers each signal for its own backends, so an outage or a log storm in one never stalls the rest.",
